    "While a round is running, the guessing team is filmed and the table is recorded with sound — so the describer's voice is captured too.": {
      "comment": "Consent card",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While a round is running, the guessing team is filmed and the table is recorded with sound — so the describer's voice is captured too."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ラウンド中は回答チームが撮影され、テーブルの音も録音されるため、説明する人の声も一緒に録音されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每輪進行緊嗰陣，估緊嘅一隊會被拍低，成張枱嘅聲音都會被錄低, 所以描述嗰個人把聲都會錄埋。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回合进行时，猜题的队伍会被拍摄，整张桌子的声音也会被录下, 因此描述者的声音也会被录到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回合進行時，猜題的隊伍會被拍攝，整張桌子的聲音也會被錄下, 因此描述者的聲音也會被錄到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
